  "description": "Start as a tiny blob in a pond. Eat food to grow from Tiny to GIANT, and make your creature your own: eyes, legs, wings, horns, a tail, a shell, any colour and a voice (C opens the maker). Meet pond friends, beat 4 silly bosses, swim under the sea, visit the volcano and the Moon, lay 6 eggs at once and raise up to 30 babies, tame wild creatures, build a nest, win races and collect 21 trophies. WASD or arrow keys move and Space flaps.",
